      "message": "test(app): re-band shared_face_bodies_finish by measured time\n\nThe six equal Z bands of the heavy 3D Finish test had a large skew.\nBand 4 took 559 s and band 1 took 12 s (release, each band alone).\nThe table EDGES now gives 12 bands in 48ths of the span: the fast\nupper half is one band, and the slow lower half has bands of 1 to 3\nparts. Each band took 35-72 s alone. The assert body of each band does\nnot change. The new default-suite test\nthe_3d_finish_bands_are_narrow_where_the_levels_are_slow keeps the\ntable narrow in the slow half.\n\nFixes #3513\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
